OL,3,GNEWSASearch for stories behind
OL,4,AWolverhampton war heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have been trying to trace
OL,7,Fthe stories of 22 war heroes listed on
OL,8,Fa memorial in their community.
OL,10,FFor more than a decade, the Trinity War
OL,11,FMemorial Community and Heritage Group
OL,12,Fhas been cleaning and restoring the
OL,13,FFirst World War tribute on Compton Road
OL,14,Fin Wolverhampton.
OL,16,FWith help from a local historian, the
OL,17,Fgroup has managed to find out about the
OL,18,Flives of 20 of the 22 names engraved on
OL,19,Fthe monument.
OL,21,FIt now hopes to learn about the final
OL,22,Ftwo - Edward Hodson and Thomas Price.
